                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "Spaceplan is an idle game that takes a lot of chances with its story and gameplay.  I can't say that they all work out: I found the pacing to be slow, the endgame movie is a couple minutes longer than it needs to be, and the ambitious UI has graphical bugs even after this many years.  Still, it does a good job of wrapping an amusing story around the gameplay that keeps it engaging.  Well worth $3 in my opinion.",
